ing, file watching, and HTTP requests. Additional capabilities include MCP support, AI image generation, a skills system, hooks, sub-agents, codebase semantic search, and AI-driven terminal sessions.","name":"Snow App","packageUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app","publisher":"MayDay","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/tag/v0.2.3","tags":["ai","chat","codex","git","mcp","ssh","terminal"]},"zh-CN":{"copyright":"版权所有 (c) 2026 MayMay","description":"面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"快速开始","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/zh-CN/1-快速开始.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/main/docs/README.md"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Snow App 是一款面向开发者的桌面应用，将 AI 对话、终端模拟、SSH 远程管理、Git 工具和内置浏览器面板整合到统一的工作空间中。它通过 Rust 原生模块处理性能关键型操作，包括 SQLite 存储、AI 流式传输、文件监控和 HTTP 请求。此外还支持 MCP 集成、AI 图像生成、技能系统、Hooks、子代理、代码库语义搜索与 AI 驱动的终端会话。","releaseNotes":"新功能\n- 插件按需发现工具：插件工具按需加载，请求级授权更完整，并附工程化示例。\n- 通知提示音：新增通知提示音及相关设置。\n- 消息操作与回退：增强消息操作，完善回退（rollback）功能。\n- 手机远控 HTTP 服务：远控 HTTP 服务新增实现，统一请求限制与响应处理。\n- 图像生成、浏览器与 Git 完善：补充各面板交互能力，统一工具命名。\n改进\n- 敏感操作确认分类：确认弹窗按拦截类型区分；脚本命中片段作为证据提交给决策模型，判定时复用前置检查结果。\n- 输入统一：加入输入法守护，统一发送判定。\n- 界面统一：分段切换器统一，优化提示词交互；主题设置表单取消宽度上限。\n修复\n- 终端焦点恢复，菜单随键盘操作收起。\n- 远程文件标签复用工作区的 SSH 连接配置。\n- 启动时即应用缓存字体。\n- 翻译任务只输出译文。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/blob/HEAD/RELEASE_NOTES_ZH.md#v0513","tags":["ai","codex","git","mcp","ssh","终端","聊天"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MayDay-wpf/snow-app/releases/tag/v0.2.3","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"171dc07f8f24ff2f